  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Resilience Through Initiatives Defining Growth Potential of Economic Solutions for SuTP (BRIDGES) - Phase III</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">TUR - Building Resilience Through Initiatives Defining Groth Potential of Economic Solutions for SuTP (BRIDGES)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BRIDGES is an integrated project approach that aims to promote social and economic self-reliance of Syrian refugees and people in host communities through employment support measures.- Long-term employment in the private sector through job placement, salary/social security subsidies, access to vocational training.- Support for home-based businesses through Productive Asset Support (especially for women), Start-Up Grants to MSMEs.- Targeted support for the CfW offer of municipalities- Counselling/training, information transfer and access to Turkish language trainingThe holistic approach is also intended to reach very vulnerable people (leave no one behind). The project is implemented by the international NGO Danish Refugee Council (DRC).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">BRIDGES ist ein integrierter Projektansatz, der durch Besch&#xe4;ftigungsf&#xf6;rderungsma&#xdf;nahmen auf die F&#xf6;rderung von sozialer und wirtschaftlicher Selbst&#xe4;ndigkeit der syrischen Fl&#xfc;chtlinge und Menschen in den aufnehmenden Gemeinden abzielt.  Langfristige Besch&#xe4;ftigung im Privatsektor durch Arbeitsvermittlung, Gehalts-/Sozialversicherungszusch&#xfc;sse, Zugang zu Berufsausbildungen  Unterst&#xfc;tzung von Home-Based-Businesses durch Productive Asset Support (v.a. f&#xfc;r Frauen), Start-Up Grants an KKMU  Gezielte Unterst&#xfc;tzung des CfW-Angebots von Gemeinden  Beratung/Trainings, Informationsvermittlung und Zugang zu t&#xfc;rkischen SprachtrainingsDurch den ganzheitlichen Ansatz sollen auch sehr vulnerable Menschen erreicht werden (leave no one behind). Das Vorhaben wird von der International NGO Danish Refugee Council (DRC) umgesetzt.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BRIDGES is an integrated project approach that aims to promote social and economic self-reliance of Syrian refugees and people in host communities through employment support measures.- Long-term employment in the private sector through job placement, salary/social security subsidies, access to vocational training.- Support for home-based businesses through Productive Asset Support (especially for women), Start-Up Grants to MSMEs.- Targeted support for the CfW offer of municipalities- Counselling/training, information transfer and access to Turkish language trainingThe holistic approach is also intended to reach very vulnerable people (leave no one behind). The project is implemented by the international NGO Danish Refugee Council (DRC).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">St&#xe4;rkung der wirtschaftlichen und sozialen Selbst&#xe4;ndigkeit von syrischen Fl&#xfc;chtlingen in der T&#xfc;rkei durch individuelle Beratungsma&#xdf;nahmen und berufliche Bildungsma&#xdf;nahmen mit dem Ziel der Aufnahme/Vermittlung von Besch&#xe4;ftigung.</narrative>
  </description>
